s!\n\nThatguyfr - Hes been with me since the very begininng of roo runners!\n\nSolkean - Making the model and being a nice and cool person to be around!\n\nAxolotily - He Made Our Music And Map Come To Life And I Could'nt Thank Him Enough!\n\nAnd To All The Players And Moderators On Our Mod Team\n\nJacko\nPoptart\nAnd Floyd\ni see you :)\n\nI hope you have a fun time playing: Roo Runners: Remastered!", "short_description": "Roo Runners is a fun game made fore having fun causing chaos and more!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/wackystudiosroorunners/piracy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AtlantisVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/wackystudiosroorunners/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25655768030789897"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823270_2255958421842801_7525033428535454957_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9lSqfafFP8AQ7kNvwG3QFsi&_nc_oc=AdqfSIdo_vygd3EGMpmAbs_K9glj2EIVFf5iszkaPP6AXM0iZGrYxzFj5hKo2saG7-E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2F3oimMHv9i6qcVFCAMkBF8gncOgjAzjvw_Ujcq6lFXQ&oe=69E4CE2D"}, "is_concept": fals